.TH "WORKERNAVIGATOR.APPCODENAME" "3JS" "April 11, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
WorkerNavigator.appCodeName \- WorkerNavigator: appCodeName property
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]Note:\f[R] This feature is only available in Web Workers.
.PP
The value of the \f[B]\f[CB]WorkerNavigator.appCodeName\f[B]\f[R]
property is always \f[CR]\(dqMozilla\(dq\f[R], in any browser.
This property is kept only for compatibility purposes.
.RS
.PP
\f[B]Note:\f[R] Do not rely on this property to return a real product
name.
All browsers return \f[CR]\(dqMozilla\(dq\f[R] as the value of this
property.
.RE
.SH VALUE
The string \f[CR]\(dqMozilla\(dq\f[R].
.SH SEE ALSO
